+/************************************************************************
+*
+* File Name: focaltech_spi.c
+*
+*    Author: FocalTech Driver Team
+*
+*   Created: 2019-03-21
+*
+*  Abstract: new spi protocol communication with TP
+*
+*   Version: v1.0
+*
